    <article class="dashboard-panel survey-insights" data-survey-insights>
      <p class="dashboard-panel__eyebrow">Admin-only analysis</p>
      <h2 class="dashboard-panel__title">Prepare the JLR meeting deck</h2>
      <p>The AI reads redacted survey comments alongside each respondent’s selected and preferred outcomes. Survey choice totals remain exact. Review its themes, suggested actions and anonymous quotes before downloading.</p>
      <p class="form-hint">Sentiment covers comments provided for each option, not every vote or every I-PACE owner. Check the wording and remove any identifying detail from quotes.</p>
